                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "textRuns": [
                                    {
                                        "value": "3. Balance the two targets — use the sliders above to test how much cost savings the network can absorb before it conflicts with the OTIF improvement goal; evaluate both scenarios together, not independently.",
