                            {
                                "textRuns": [
                                    {
                                        "value": "Implementation considerations: these are directional planning scenarios, not committed cost reductions. Actual savings depend on carrier contract terms and lead time — validate any target against live carrier negotiations before finalizing the routing plan.",
